ly buy it on Apple's website and Beats' Douyin store. It sold out quickly.", "The box shows Pikachu and Mimikyu. The speaker also has these two characters on the front. Small metal lightning bolts sit around Pikachu.", "The speaker costs the same as the normal one. It plays music for 24 hours. It is also water resistant, so you can use it outside.", "Some sellers now ask two or three times the price. Beats and Pokemon fans love this product, but buyers should be careful."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这款特别版 Beats Pill 于 10 月 13 日开售。你只能在苹果官网和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店购买。它很快就卖光了。", "包装盒上有皮卡丘和谜拟丘的形象。音箱正面也有这两个角色。皮卡丘周围还嵌着小小的金属闪电。", "这款音箱和普通版价格一样。它能播放 24 小时音乐。它还能防水，所以可以在户外使用。", "现在一些卖家要价达到原价的两三倍。Beats 和宝可梦的粉丝很喜欢这款产品，但买家还是要小心。"], "body": "The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on Apple's website and Beats' Douyin store. It sold out quickly.\n\nThe box shows Pikachu and Mimikyu. The speaker also has these two characters on the front. Small metal lightning bolts sit around Pikachu.\n\nThe speaker costs the same as the normal one. It plays music for 24 hours. It is also water resistant, so you can use it outside.\n\nSome sellers now ask two or three times the price. Beats and Pokemon fans love this product, but buyers should be careful.", "body_zh": "这款特别版 Beats Pill 于 10 月 13 日开售。你只能在苹果官网和 Beats 抖音官方旗舰店购买。它很快就卖光了。\n\n包装盒上有皮卡丘和谜拟丘的形象。音箱正面也有这两个角色。皮卡丘周围还嵌着小小的金属闪电。\n\n这款音箱和普通版价格一样。它能播放 24 小时音乐。它还能防水，所以可以在户外使用。\n\n现在一些卖家要价达到原价的两三倍。Beats 和宝可梦的粉丝很喜欢这款产品，但买家还是要小心。", "text": "The special Beats Pill went on sale on October 13. You could only buy it on Apple's website and Beats' Douyin store. It sold out quickly. The box shows Pikachu and Mimikyu. The speaker also has these two characters on the front. Small metal lightning bolts sit around Pikachu. The speaker costs the same as the normal one. It plays music for 24 hours. It is also water resistant, so you can use it outside. Some sellers now ask two or three times the price. Beats and Pokemon fans love this product, but 